Cell["\<\
Set up rule to account for all the contributions in the integration of \
\[Delta] and \[Delta]\[CloseCurlyQuote]. See again the Operator section for \
more details.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{66, 10}, {7, 8}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8929764507177553`*^9, 3.892976494829124*^9}, {
