5831aa8a8402"],

Cell["\<\
Checking large-r behaviour of retarded metric reconstruction. Since in IRG \
\[CapitalPhi]~r^3, we expect the metric to go overall as ~r
(need to define a norm to make this precise \[Rule]  take the worst behaviour \
of each tetrad component).
See arXiv 1004.2276, Table I p.8 and thereabouts for more details.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50.34765625, 10}, {7, 8}},
 Evaluatable->False,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.891066041118039*^9, 3.8910660725641203`*^9}, {
