Cell["\<\
Can improve the agreement by fitting. Specifically, we can make a best fit \
for the power-law decay of the residual field and then sum over this fit over \
the full range of l.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{66, 10}, {7, 8}},
 Evaluatable->False,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.888052764204144*^9, 3.888052821865348*^9}, {
