Cell[TextData[{
 "For the derivatives below, checked that substituting known values of \
derivatives of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["h", "P"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f0865ee2-0224-4c24-86c8-b19b492dbb5a"],
 ", instead of differentiating the interpolating polynomials (see commented \
out part), makes no difference."
}], "Text",
